    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tdhl](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tdhl) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 64.644 depth occurred on Sep 02 2026 35km SE of Foao. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -3.2128 longitude 139.3732. It impacted 215751 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
